  "title": "EMDR Therapy for Anxiety, Panic, and Trauma Responses",
  "sourceUrl": "",
  "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1768843623788\" id=\"item-696e692a8d927f73d3f744ee\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/f2f33f3e-f102-4470-9086-4fff458f9fa4_912/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/f2f33f3e-f102-4470-9086-4fff458f9fa4_912/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"cfd2110e4c49fc16d5ed\" id=\"block-cfd2110e4c49fc16d5ed\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Anxiety often has roots in unresolved trauma — even when the original event doesn’t seem “traumatic.”</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">👉 <a href=\"/news/2026/1/18/emdr-therapy-for-trauma-and-ptsd-in-tyler-tx\"><strong>EMDR Therapy for Trauma and PTSD in Tyler, TX</strong></a></p><h2 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">How Trauma Drives Anxiety</h2><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Trauma can cause the nervous system to stay in fight-or-flight mode, leading to:</p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Panic attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Chronic worry</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Physical tension</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Sleep difficulties</p></li></ul><h2 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">How EMDR Helps Anxiety</h2><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">EMDR addresses the <strong>underlying memories</strong> driving anxiety, not just the symptoms. As trauma is processed, anxiety often decreases naturally.</p><h2 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">EMDR vs Coping Skills Alone</h2><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">While coping skills help manage anxiety, EMDR helps resolve the source — allowing long-term relief.</p><h2 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Anxiety Therapy in Tyler, TX</h2><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">👉 <a href=\"/schedule-an-apointment\"><strong>Schedule an EMDR consultation</strong></a> to explore treatment options.</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-cfd2110e4c49fc16d5ed {\n    \n    \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-cfd2110e4c49fc16d5ed .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-cfd2110e4c49fc16d5ed {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-cfd2110e4c49fc16d5ed {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-cfd2110e4c49fc16d5ed {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-cfd2110e4c49fc16d5ed .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>",
